0..77 Comment "// The twin of `model/effects/domhringr.gandr`: a law over continuations that"
78..152 Comment "// names the value an operation answers where its sort does not stand. The"
153..231 Comment "// name `bind x . …` binds is a value of the sort the operation answers, and"
232..273 Comment "// it stands only at a port of that sort."
275..349 Comment "/// A put answers a digest, not a value: putting the digest a put answered"
350..396 Comment "/// names a `Digest` at the port of a `Value`."
